## Architecture

```
lib/
  app/                 App widget ({{app_widget}}, theme, l10n)
  bootstrap.dart       startup shared by every lib/main_<flavor>.dart
  core/                cross-feature contracts and their single implementation
    asset_resolver/    ImageResourceResolver + SVG/PNG image resources (the only place asset paths live)
    config/            AppFlavor, AppConfig (base URL, DSNs via --dart-define)
    di/                {{di_summary}}
    error_reporting/   CrashReporter + adapter
    logging/           AppLogger
    network/           AppApiClient contract + {{api_client_class}}, AppFailure, converter, JsonSerializer, interceptors
    routing/           {{routing_summary}}
    theming/           AppTheme, AppColors, AppSpacing, AppRadius, context extensions
    widgets/           shared widgets (FailureView)
  features/<name>/
    domain/            entities, repository contracts, use cases (pure Dart)
    data/              models (JSON), remote data sources, repository impls
    presentation/      screens + {{presentation_state}}
    <name>_{{feature_di_file}}.dart   DI wiring for the feature
    <name>.dart        barrel: exports only the screen
```

Dependency rule: `presentation -> domain <- data`. `domain/` imports nothing
from `data/`, `presentation/` or Flutter. Features never import other
features; shared pieces move to `core/`.

## Non-negotiables

1. Network only through `AppApiClient`. Never import {{network_packages}}
   outside `lib/core/network/`. Models decoded by the client get one
   `serializer.addParser<XModel>(XModel.fromJson)` in `lib/core/di/`.
2. Errors are values: data sources and repositories return
   `Either<AppFailure, T>` (dartz). Nothing throws across layers.
3. {{state_rule}}
4. {{navigation_rule}}
5. Theme: `context.colors`, `context.appColors`, `context.textTheme`,
   `AppSpacing`, `AppRadius`. No `Color(0x...)`, no bare padding numbers.
6. Images and icons: `ImageResourceResolver.x.getImageWidget(...)`. Files
   go in `assets/icons/` or `assets/images/` with one resolver entry each;
   no `'assets/...'` string outside `lib/core/asset_resolver/`.
7. User-visible text: `context.l10n.<key>` only, keys in
   `lib/l10n/arb/app_en.arb`.
8. Log through `AppLogger`, report unexpected errors through
   `CrashReporter`. No `print`.
9. Secrets and base URLs never in source: `--dart-define` or CI secrets.
10. Every change ships with tests (`test/` mirrors `lib/`), and
    `./scripts/quality_gate.sh` passes before you say you are done.

